{"id":"md-001","ops":[{"op":"add","name":"likes-pool","type":"semantic","content":"要带泳池","salience":0.6,"sourceRuns":[1]},{"op":"add","name":"likes-pool","type":"semantic","content":"要带泳池","salience":0.4,"sourceRuns":[2],"mergedFrom":["x"]}],"expect":{"survivors":["likes-pool"],"salience":{"likes-pool":0.6},"fields":{"likes-pool":{"sourceRuns":[1,2],"mergedFrom":["x"]}}},"why":"同名+同内容 = 同一条记忆被重复确认 → salience 取 max(0.6)、血缘取并集","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true}}
{"id":"md-002","ops":[{"op":"add","name":"pool-pref","type":"semantic","content":"要带泳池","salience":0.9},{"op":"add","name":"pool-pref","type":"semantic","content":"不要泳池了,改看无泳池的","salience":0.4}],"expect":{"survivors":["pool-pref"],"salience":{"pool-pref":0.4},"content_contains":{"pool-pref":"不要泳池"}},"why":"同名+内容改变 = 偏好反转 → 新值替换旧值,salience 跟随【新内容】而非取 max。取 max 会把一个过时的高分挂在新内容上","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true,"note":"conflict resolution: same-name contradiction, recency wins"}}
{"id":"md-003","ops":[{"op":"add","name":"stale","type":"semantic","content":"c","salience":0.2},{"op":"age","name":"stale","days":400},{"op":"compact","minScore":0.08}],"expect":{"survivors":[],"removed":["stale"]},"why":"低 salience + 长期未用 → compScore 跌破 0.08 → 衰减淘汰","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true}}
{"id":"md-004","ops":[{"op":"add","name":"a","type":"semantic","content":"c","salience":0.9},{"op":"add","name":"b","type":"semantic","content":"c","salience":0.6},{"op":"add","name":"c","type":"semantic","content":"c","salience":0.3},{"op":"compact","maxSemantic":2}],"expect":{"survivors":["a","b"],"removed":["c"]},"why":"超容量 → 按 compScore 留 top-N,最低分被淘汰","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true}}
{"id":"md-005","ops":[{"op":"add","name":"a","type":"semantic","content":"c","salience":0.9},{"op":"add","name":"b","type":"semantic","content":"c","salience":0.6},{"op":"add","name":"c","type":"episodic","content":"c","salience":0.5},{"op":"compact","maxSemantic":1,"maxEpisodic":1}],"expect":{"survivors":["a","c"],"removed":["b"],"idempotent":true},"why":"两个类型各自独立限额;并断言【压缩是幂等的】——连跑两次结果必须相同,否则每次整理都会继续啃掉记忆","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true,"note":"idempotency"}}
{"id":"md-006","ops":[{"op":"add","name":"high","type":"semantic","content":"c","salience":0.8},{"op":"add","name":"low","type":"semantic","content":"c","salience":0.2}],"expect":{"score_order":["high","low"]},"why":"信号活性探针①:只有 salience 不同 → compScore 必须跟着 salience 排序","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true,"note":"signal liveness: salience"}}
{"id":"md-007","ops":[{"op":"add","name":"fresh","type":"semantic","content":"c","salience":0.5},{"op":"add","name":"old","type":"semantic","content":"c","salience":0.5},{"op":"age","name":"old","days":365}],"expect":{"score_order":["fresh","old"]},"why":"信号活性探针②:只有新鲜度不同 → recency 必须生效。若这条失败说明 recency 是死信号","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true,"note":"signal liveness: recency"}}
{"id":"md-008","ops":[{"op":"add","name":"used","type":"semantic","content":"c","salience":0.5},{"op":"add","name":"unused","type":"semantic","content":"c","salience":0.5},{"op":"touch","name":"used","times":20}],"expect":{"score_order":["used","unused"]},"why":"信号活性探针③:只有 useCount 不同 → frequency 必须生效。记忆里曾有过一个 confidence 死字段(从不被 compScore 消费),这类探针就是为了自动发现同类问题","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true,"note":"signal liveness: frequency"}}
{"id":"md-009","ops":[{"op":"add","name":"wants-pool","type":"semantic","content":"买家坚持要带泳池","salience":0.7},{"op":"add","name":"no-pool-please","type":"semantic","content":"买家明确说不要泳池","salience":0.7},{"op":"compact"}],"expect":{"survivors":["wants-pool","no-pool-please"]},"why":"【已知缺口】异名语义矛盾:两条内容相反但名字不同,确定性层没有任何网能发现——只有同名/同槽才有确定消解,跨内容的矛盾靠 LLM 子 agent 尽力,命名纪律承重。本条断言的是【当前行为】(两条都留下),并标记为缺口:哪天有人补了确定性消解,这条会失败,评测会提醒","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true,"known_gap":true,"note":"cross-name contradiction has no deterministic net"}}
{"id":"md-010","ops":[{"op":"add","name":"a","type":"semantic","content":"c","salience":0.5},{"op":"add","name":"b","type":"semantic","content":"c","salience":0.5},{"op":"touch","name":"b","times":30}],"expect":{"score_order":["b","a"],"rank_order_differs":true},"why":"【设计不一致探针】compScore(压缩用)= salience×recency×frequency,而 rank(选择降级用)= salience×recency,不含 frequency。所以同一批记忆在【压缩】和【无 LLM 选择】下排序可能不同。断言这个差异存在,以免它被当成 bug 反复发现——但它值得记一笔:被频繁用到的记忆在降级选择里得不到加分","meta":{"source":"human","verified":true,"note":"documented inconsistency: rank() omits frequency"}}
